---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import ActionPlayground from '../../../components/component-docs/ActionPlayground.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../../components/component-docs/CodeBlock.astro';
import Button from '../../../components/actions/Button.astro';
import IconButton from '../../../components/actions/IconButton.astro';
import ButtonGroup from '../../../components/actions/ButtonGroup.astro';
import TextLink from '../../../components/actions/TextLink.astro';
import { actionDocs, type ActionDoc } from '../../../components/actions/catalog';
import { loadingExample } from '../../../components/actions/examples';
import { href } from '../../../data';
import '../../../styles/component-docs.css';
export function getStaticPaths(){return actionDocs.map(doc=>({params:{component:doc.slug},props:{doc}}));}
const {doc}=Astro.props as {doc:ActionDoc};
const toc=[{id:'preview',label:'Live preview'},{id:'variants',label:'Variants and sizes'},{id:'states',label:'Interaction states'},{id:'properties',label:'Properties'},{id:'usage',label:'Usage guidance'},{id:'accessibility',label:'Accessibility'},{id:'implementation',label:'Implementation'},{id:'foundations',label:'Foundation references'}];
---
<DocsLayout page={doc.id} toc={toc}>
 <div class="component-docs" data-action-document={doc.slug}>
  <div class="component-preview-notice"><strong>Approved component reference · explicit token status.</strong> These are real reusable components. Supported token bindings and approved exceptions are implemented. Unrelated candidate role names remain explicit; no public package release is implied.</div>
  <section class="doc-section" id="preview"><h2>Try it out.</h2><p>Change the configuration and interact with the actual component. The copyable example follows your configuration.</p><ActionPlayground kind={doc.slug}/></section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="variants"><h2>Variants and sizes</h2><div class="component-variants">{doc.variants.map(([name,purpose])=><div class="component-variant-row"><div><strong>{name}</strong><p>{purpose}</p></div>{doc.slug==='button'&&<Button variant={name.startsWith('Primary')?'primary':name.startsWith('Secondary')?'secondary':name.startsWith('Ghost')?'ghost':'destructive'} data-example-activation>{name==='Destructive'?'Remove item':name.startsWith('Ghost')?'Learn more':'Continue'}</Button>}{doc.slug==='icon-button'&&<IconButton icon="check-circle" label="Mark complete" toggle={name==='Toggle'} data-example-activation/>}{doc.slug==='button-group'&&<ButtonGroup label={name+' example'} variant={name==='Joined'?'joined':'separated'}><Button size="small" data-example-activation>Save</Button><Button variant="secondary" size="small" data-example-activation>Cancel</Button></ButtonGroup>}{doc.slug==='text-link'&&<TextLink href={href('foundations/colour/')} variant={name==='Subtle'?'subtle':'default'} target={name==='New tab'?'_blank':undefined}>Explore colour</TextLink>}</div>)}</div><p class="size-reference">{doc.sizes}</p>{doc.slug!=='button-group'&&<div class="component-example-row">{(['small','medium','large'] as const).map(size=>doc.slug==='button'?<Button size={size} data-example-activation>{size}</Button>:doc.slug==='icon-button'?<IconButton size={size} icon="check-circle" label={'Mark complete ('+size+')'} data-example-activation/>:<TextLink href={href('foundations/typography/')} size={size}>{size}</TextLink>)}</div>}</section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="states"><h2>Interaction states</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">State</th><th scope="col">Behaviour</th></tr></thead><tbody>{doc.states.map(([state,behaviour])=><tr><td>{state}</td><td>{behaviour}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
   {(doc.slug==='button'||doc.slug==='icon-button')&&<><div class="component-example-row">{['default','disabled','loading'].map(state=><div class="component-state-sample"><span>{state}</span>{doc.slug==='button'?<Button disabled={state==='disabled'} loading={state==='loading'} data-example-activation>Continue</Button>:<IconButton icon="check-circle" label={'Mark complete ('+state+')'} disabled={state==='disabled'} loading={state==='loading'} data-example-activation/>}</div>)}</div><Button variant="secondary" data-demo-async>Run loading example</Button><p class="action-async-status" role="status" data-async-status>Local timing demonstration. No data is sent.</p></>}
   <p class="component-preview-help">Hover, focus and pressed appearances come from actual pointer and keyboard interaction, not a separate mockup. Error and success belong to feedback around an operation, not an extra visual state on these actions.</p><p role="status" class="component-preview-status" data-example-status></p>
  </section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="properties"><h2>Properties and configuration</h2><p>These properties describe the local source implementation shown above.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Property</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody>{doc.properties.map(row=><tr>{row.map(cell=><td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="usage"><h2>Use with intent.</h2><div class="guidance-pair"><div><h3>When to use</h3><ul class="checklist">{doc.use.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul></div><div><h3>When not to use</h3><ul class="checklist">{doc.avoid.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul></div></div></section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="accessibility"><h2>Accessibility</h2><ul class="checklist">{doc.accessibility.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul></section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="implementation"><h2>Developer notes</h2><ul class="checklist">{doc.implementation.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul><p class="source-note">Copyable examples are intended for a page under <code>website/src/pages/</code> in this Astro project. Font styles are included by Button and Text link. The components use the surrounding <code>data-theme="light"</code> or <code>data-theme="dark"</code> ancestor; without one, their explicit default is Light. They do not implement Figma modes or a production token package.</p>{doc.slug==='button'&&<CodeBlock code={loadingExample}/>}</section>
  <section class="doc-section" id="foundations"><h2>Related foundations and token status.</h2><p>Supported styles now consume the local token exports. See <a href={href('design-tokens/')}>Design Tokens</a> for actual alias mappings, candidate status and retained declarations.</p><p>The references below point to existing foundation values. Their assignment to component roles is provisional; these are not official semantic or component token names.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Role</th><th scope="col">Existing foundation references</th></tr></thead><tbody>{doc.references.map(([role,refs])=><tr><td>{role}</td><td>{refs}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="source-note">Remaining decisions: public package/API naming, unrelated candidate state-role assignments and the icon-toggle inset indicator. Large 56px controls, full capsules, 2px focus offsets and standard button easing are approved. Spinner timing is an approved retained 960ms loading exception, independent of slow transition timing; reduced motion stops rotation. No missing production decision is silently promoted.</p></section>
 </div>
</DocsLayout>
